  "checklist": [
    "I can tell *u* from *ou* when listening and speaking.",
    "I read *oi, au, eau, ai, eu* as a single sound.",
    "I recognise nasal vowels.",
    "I know when the nasal disappears (*bon* → *bonne*).",
    "I know a final *e* is usually silent."
  ],
  "challenge": {
    "title": "Record yourself for 30 seconds",
    "text": "Record a voice note introducing yourself and listen to it. You can use this model: *Bonjour ! Je m'appelle… J'aime le pain, le vin rouge et la couleur bleue. Au revoir !* Check that your *u* uses rounded lips, that the final *e* in *rouge* is silent and that the nasals go through your nose."
  }
